1,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,the end of the world with our own eyes.Comment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,So let's go, Captain I'll-Do-It-My-Way!Comment: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.72,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Whaddya mean, "no can do"?Comment: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:07.89,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,We haven't even started yet!Comment: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:12.72,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,I wanna know it all!  Now, yes, we can!Comment: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:18.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes, we can!  You can!  This moment...Comment: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.10,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,We can!  I can!  With this feeling of freedom...Comment: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.32,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Now...  Now, oh yes, we can!Comment: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.64,Lyrics,,0,0,0,karaoke,Yes, we can!Comment: 0,0:01:35.34,0:01:37.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:03.67,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono sekai no hate nanteComment: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:06.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono me de mita wake janaiComment: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:13.95,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dakara tabidatsun da kimi to, WII KYAN!Comment: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:27.00,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Umi kara umi wo mata ni kaketeComment: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.91,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Daremo ga waratteiru kedoComment: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:38.78,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Souzou tsukanaikoto bakari daroComment: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:43.56,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Miteminufuri suruna yoComment: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:50.04,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Joushiki nante sa tasuuketsuComment: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:54.08,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono sekai no hate nanteComment: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.41,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kono me de mita wake janaiComment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.96,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dakara ikou ze AMANO JYAKKU senchouComment: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.72,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Dekiyashinai koto tte nani?Comment: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:07.89,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Mada nani mo hajimatte naiComment: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:12.72,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Subete shiritain da ima, IESU WII KYANComment: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:18.68,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,IESU WII KYAN! YUU KYAN! Kono shunkanComment: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.10,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,WII KYAN! AI KYAN! Kono kaikanComment: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.32,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Ima ima, OO IESU WII KYAN!Comment: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.64,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,IESU WII KYAN!Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.82,Kanji,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:03.67,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この世｜せ界｜か#｜いの果｜はてなんてComment: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:06.82,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この目｜めで見｜みたわけじゃないComment: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:13.95,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,だから旅｜た#｜び立｜!だつんだ 君｜き#｜みとウィーキャン！Comment: 0,0:00:23.67,0:00:27.00,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,海｜う#｜みから海｜う#｜みを股｜ま#｜たにかけてComment: 0,0:00:29.06,0:00:31.91,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,誰｜だ#｜れもが笑｜わ#｜らっているけどComment: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:38.78,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,想｜そう像｜!ぞ#｜うつかない真｜こ実｜!とばかりだろComment: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:43.56,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,見｜みて見｜みぬ振｜ふりするなよComment: 0,0:00:43.56,0:00:50.04,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,常｜じょ#｜う識｜!し#｜きなんてさ 多｜た数｜!す#｜う決｜!け#｜つComment: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:54.08,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この世｜せ界｜か#｜いの果｜はてなんてComment: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:57.41,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,この目｜めで見｜みたわけじゃないComment: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:01.96,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,だから行｜いこうぜ アマノジャック船｜せん長｜!ちょうComment: 0,0:01:01.96,0:01:04.72,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,出｜で来｜!きやしないことって何｜な#｜に？Comment: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:07.89,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,まだ何｜な#｜にも始｜は#｜じまってないComment: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:12.72,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,すべて知｜しりたいんだ 今｜い#｜まイエス・ウィーキャン！Comment: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:18.68,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,イエス・ウィーキャン！ユー・キャン！ この瞬｜しゅ#｜ん間｜!か#｜んComment: 0,0:01:19.06,0:01:24.10,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,ウィーキャン！アイキャン！ この快｜か#｜い感｜!か#｜んComment: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:31.32,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,今｜い#｜ま 今｜い#｜ま オー・イエス・ウィーキャン！Comment: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:38.64,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,イエス・ウィーキャン！Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:44.37,Title,,0,0,0,,To the East BlueDialogue: 0,0:02:08.31,0:02:13.30,Main,,0,0,0,,They're developing quickly!  They're absolutely superhuman!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.94,0:02:16.37,Main,,0,0,0,,– Father! – Father-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:23.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of all of you!Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.73,0:02:32.25,Main,,0,0,0,,My beloved children!Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.68,0:02:45.56,Captions,,0,0,0,,Six Months into  Sanji's ImprisonmentDialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:59.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Where do they take the fancy food we've been making?Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. There aren't any guests in the castle.Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:08.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be nosy! His Majesty ordered us to cook, so we're going to cook.Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:50.46,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Royalty mustn't serve anyone! How many times do I have to tell you this?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:52.62,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Your mother is dead!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:55.39,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Stop chasing her shadow!Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.05,0:04:04.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:07.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:10.93,Main,,0,0,0,,– Ow, ow, ow! – Are you alright, Sanji-sama?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.12,0:04:15.76,Main,,0,0,0,,His Majesty ordered us not to allow you into the kitchen.Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:17.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Please!Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:19.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me... stay!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:34.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It's done!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:47.66,Main,,0,0,0,,– Where are you going all on your own? – To see my mother.Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.66,0:04:51.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The medical ward is at the far end, and the weather is...Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:52.91,Main,,0,0,0,,– I can do it. – But...Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:54.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't follow me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:04:59.90,Main,,0,0,0,,And don't tell my father.Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:13.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Get back inside!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:33.47,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! This isn't your food!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.49,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.75,0:06:03.17,Main,,0,0,0,,S-Sanji-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:05.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you come here all on your own?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:13.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the sentiment.Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.76,0:06:18.69,Main,,0,0,0,,But we can't let Her Majesty's stomach hurt.Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:25.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Still, maybe it tastes better than it...Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:31.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:45.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:49.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you come to visit me in this storm?Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.13,0:06:52.23,Main,,0,0,0,,If your father finds out, he'll be furious.Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:54.43,Main,,0,0,0,,– Uh-huh. – Your Majesty.Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:06:57.56,Main,,0,0,0,,This is from Sanji-sama.Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.11,0:07:03.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you make this for me?Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:05.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Mm... Mm-hm.Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.52,0:07:10.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Epony!Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, your Majesty!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.44,0:07:17.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be presumptuous! Bring me what Sanji cooked for me!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.42,0:07:20.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, okay.Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:25.41,Main,,0,0,0,,But it was damaged on his way here, so I threw it in the trash.Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:26.67,Main,,0,0,0,,– Bring it to me! – Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:32.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, nice!Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:36.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Scrambled eggs, fish, and bananas?Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:39.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:41.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I messed it up!Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.26,0:07:43.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I tripped and dropped it on my way here.Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:46.65,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been crushed and it got wet in the rain...Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:48.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's try it.Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:55.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Yummy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:00.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.76,0:08:03.12,Main,,0,0,0,,– Really?! – Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:05.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:08.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji, will you cook for me again?Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.50,0:08:33.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:38.12,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sanji, will you cook for me again?Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:53.76,Main,,0,0,0,,You want cookbooks and utensils?Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,"All... Blue"?Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.38,0:09:24.16,Main,,0,0,0,,"Where fish from all four seas live..."Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.55,0:09:27.70,Main,,0,0,0,,"A legendary sea"!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.34,0:09:34.72,Main,,0,0,0,,See! I told you Sanji was down here.Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.71,0:09:38.55,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right! That's totally him!Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:43.68,Main,,0,0,0,,So he's still alive after all! Why did Father lie to us?Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:45.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Probably because he wishes he were dead.Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:53.80,Main,,0,0,0,,In that case, if he really does die, will Father be happy?Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.65,0:10:18.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:26.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a failure who deserves to die, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.28,0:10:41.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow...Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:46.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't assume that I'm on your side. I don't want to get dragged into this!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:50.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Those three are Father's ideal soldiers.Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:54.96,Main,,0,0,0,,They lack emotions like pity, sympathy, and even sadness.Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.47,0:11:02.64,Main,,0,0,0,,My body was successfully augmented, but that's one area where I'm different from them.Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:04.86,Main,,0,0,0,,See you later.Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you, Reiju...Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.43,0:11:12.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. We're going to be climbing the Red Line soon.Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:16.44,Main,,0,0,0,,We're going to wage war in the East Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:18.96,Main,,0,0,0,,War?Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.86,0:11:24.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Set course for the East Blue!Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:37.65,Main,,0,0,0,,The estimate arrival time is three weeks.Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:31.20,Captions,,0,1030,350,,The East BlueDialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:42.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Reiju, I...Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:52.13,Main,,0,0,0,,... I...Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.13,0:12:54.08,Main,,0,0,0,,... want to be a cook!Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.15,0:12:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:04.30,Main,,0,0,0,,– It's Germa 66. – What?! They're real?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:15.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Judge-sama, our targets in Kojia have noticed us!Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:18.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Crush them!Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:24.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me before?  Don't tell me something like that!Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:31.62,Main,,0,0,0,,If I can... escaoe...Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,... here in the East Blue...Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:43.15,Main,,0,0,0,,... I'll never...Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:46.06,Main,,0,0,0,,... have to see...Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.69,0:13:49.76,Main,,0,0,0,,... Father's face again, right?Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:13:58.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Step back!Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.69,0:14:05.86,Main,,0,0,0,,This is your only chance!Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.86,0:14:07.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't screw up!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.70,0:14:17.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Go ashore!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.80,0:14:30.64,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just begun!Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:35.15,Main,,0,0,0,,The key to your iron mask is in Father-sama's room! Go get it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.15,0:14:36.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:38.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go see what's going on outside!Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:40.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:41.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.11,0:14:45.11,Main,,0,0,0,,When you get into his room, look for a skull symbol on the wall!Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.11,0:14:47.85,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll find a safe there!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:04.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I got it!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.24,0:15:07.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing over there?Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:16.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji... Why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.26,0:15:22.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Father-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:32.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving this country! Don't try to stop me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:37.95,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems your imprisonment has harshened your words.Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.95,0:15:44.92,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no chance that an ordinary boy like you could survive in this sea, or any sea, for that matter.Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You will die!Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.67,0:15:58.13,Main,,0,0,0,,So what?! You can't stop me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.13,0:15:59.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a relief!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm human after all.Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:10.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though you're useless, I couldn't bring myself to kill my own son.Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.69,0:16:14.36,Main,,0,0,0,,But you want to leave on your own?Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I will not stop you. Take the key to that iron mask and leave.Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.17,0:16:34.76,Main,,0,0,0,,But I have one more thing to ask as your father, Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.68,0:16:41.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't ever admit that I'm your father...Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.76,0:16:47.06,Main,,0,0,0,,... to even a single person!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.71,0:16:56.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I do not want anyone to learn of my shame.Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:58.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.79,0:17:50.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What should we do about the cruise ship at the port?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:54.59,Main,,0,0,0,,They aren't our target! There's just in the wrong place! Leave them alone!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.76,0:17:59.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Get on that ship!Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.97,0:18:04.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji! You're a boy! Stop crying already!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:09.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen! Don't ever come back here!Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:10.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:16.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The sea's a huge place! You'll...Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.53,0:18:22.99,Main,,0,0,0,,... you'll definitely find people who will accept you!Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't look back!Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.51,0:18:42.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Run! Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:19.22,Captions,,970,0,340,,Seducing Woods Luffy vs. CrackerDialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:19.22,Captions,,0,1020,315,,11 Hours Since the Battle BeganDialogue: 0,0:19:32.84,0:19:36.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Yummy! It's nice and crunchy!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.27,0:19:37.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:41.24,Main,,0,0,0,,He ate Cracker-sama's Biscuit Soldiers-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.24,0:19:42.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:45.41,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you eat them!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:48.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Biscuits are food!Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:52.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, Luffy!  Once you eat them, they can't come back!Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:54.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Eat as many of them as you can!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What a crafty woman-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.06,0:20:27.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Is he conscious?Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.60,0:20:34.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way.Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:38.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Reiju-sama, we're about to treat his...Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.75,0:20:40.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I said get out of my way!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:50.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Good grief.Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.34,0:20:54.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you going to meet your fiancée with that face?Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.58,0:21:01.18,Main,,0,0,0,,This could've all been avoided if you had just forgetten about that restaurant owner.Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.15,0:21:04.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you come back?Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:10.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought that you wanted to forget about this place?Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:11.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:38.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm stuffed now.Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.02,0:21:40.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw you!Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:46.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of fighting you already!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.70,0:21:51.95,Main,,0,0,0,,You fight, run away, then come back and eat!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.37,0:21:56.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he really human?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.77,0:22:00.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Cracker-sama is amazing,  but so is Straw Hat's appetite!Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.21,0:22:03.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Cracker-sama...Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.23,0:22:07.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, are his biscuits really infinite?Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.09,0:22:09.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right-ju.Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.05,0:22:12.47,Main,,0,0,0,,But his stamina can't be!Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.47,0:22:14.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll outlast you!Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.58,0:22:19.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Eat until you burst!  Then your comrades will give up!Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:21.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll eat every last one!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:24.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll eat and eat and take Sanji back!Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:30.23,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll bring out more Biscuit Soldiers for you, then.Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.99,0:22:38.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Eat them and pop, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.21,0:22:42.84,Main,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:48.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll tell Mama that you aided them, King Baum!Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.16,0:22:51.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! But you already chopped off the top of my head!Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.39,0:22:54.47,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not fair-ju, Cracker-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:23:00.73,Main,,0,0,0,,She's using the power of Mama's Vivre Card against us-ju!Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.73,0:23:03.98,Main,,0,0,0,,So, in a way, we are obeying Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:08.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Save your excuses for Mama! The fact is, you interfered with my mission!Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.91,0:23:16.37,Main,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for her rain,  my hard Biscuit Soldiers...Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.37,0:23:20.42,Main,,0,0,0,,... wouldn't have softened up into tasty, chewable snacks!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:24.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! This is a fight between pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.45,0:23:28.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We figured out your weakness, but that doesn't mean you should take it out on my soldiers!Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.01,0:23:30.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Your?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.43,0:23:31.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Are we...Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:34.10,Main,,0,0,0,,... her soldiers now?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.92,0:23:36.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What was that?Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.60,0:23:38.60,Main,,0,0,0,,We're sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.77,0:23:43.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's put an end to this, Biscuit Soldiers!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.51,0:23:47.57,Main,,0,0,0,,This should end it!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.40,0:23:53.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess I gotta eat them. They'll keep coming if I break them.Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.78,0:23:55.27,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.27,0:23:57.70,Main,,0,0,0,,... I'm getting pretty full now.Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.70,0:24:01.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Make sure to protect me, Homies!Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.07,0:24:02.17,Main,,0,0,0,,G-Got it!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.17,0:24:06.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, can I try something other than eating them?Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.30,0:24:10.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll fight them for a while, and then continue.Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.20,0:24:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Weather Egg!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.59,0:24:16.01,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're related to an Emperor...Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.72,0:24:20.77,Main,,0,0,0,,... Luffy's going to be the Pirate King!Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.77,0:24:24.02,Main,,0,0,0,,So there's no limit to his appetite!Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.10,0:24:28.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Nami, I've been eating all night...Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.23,0:24:31.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Is his stomach bottomless?Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.76,0:24:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.74,0:24:34.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Rain Spark!Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.24,0:24:43.75,Main,,0,0,0,,The soldiers are going to soften up again! Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.93,0:24:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,No... I can't...Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.22,0:25:03.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.52,0:25:05.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.22,0:25:17.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at that gluttony!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.16,0:25:26.62,Captions,,0,0,0,,Germa 66Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.62,0:25:29.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Judge-sama, it is time.Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.34,0:25:32.08,Main,,0,0,0,,The preparations are complete.Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.08,0:25:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Good, inform my children.Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.34,0:25:38.89,Main,,0,0,0,,We're leaving for Whole Cake Chateau!Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.56,0:25:43.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Ready? This might sting a little.Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.09,0:25:44.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and do it.Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.24,0:25:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It feels a little weird...Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.48,0:25:53.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it.Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.74,0:25:56.86,Main,,0,0,0,,How does it feel?Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.95,0:26:05.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The swelling has gone down.Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.83,0:26:06.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.91,0:26:09.98,Main,,0,0,0,,That pack only works for swelling.Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.98,0:26:15.42,Main,,0,0,0,,It's suppressing the body's normal response, so it's actually preventing it from healing.Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.42,0:26:18.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But it's better than your fiancée seeing your swollen face.Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.20,0:26:25.35,Main,,0,0,0,,The members of the Charlotte Family don't take their spouses' family name.Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.51,0:26:28.98,Main,,0,0,0,,So if they accept you as a part of their family,  you can live a happy life.Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.67,0:26:31.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you...Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.22,0:26:36.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You came back on your own. I don't owe you anything.Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.80,0:26:38.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't get another chance.Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.28,0:26:47.37,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, where did you pick up that sense of chivalry?Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.75,0:26:57.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Women! Women! Women! Women!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.26,0:26:58.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Women!Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.43,0:27:04.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! We don't need a female chef!Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.02,0:27:08.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.02,0:27:15.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm the type of man that reinforces my lessons through kicks.Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.02,0:27:17.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't do that to a woman!Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.99,0:27:22.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Why not?! If she doesn't listen, then just kick her, too!Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.03,0:27:24.43,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.83,0:27:30.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.12,0:27:33.13,Main,,0,0,0,,A man can't kick a woman!Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.13,0:27:37.05,Main,,0,0,0,,That's been the rule since the age of the dinosaurs!Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.42,0:27:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, Little Eggplant!Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.50,0:27:43.55,Main,,0,0,0,,You can make all kinds of mistakes as a human being!Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.55,0:27:47.18,Main,,0,0,0,,But if you ever fail at being a proper man...Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.18,0:27:51.56,Main,,0,0,0,,... I'll cut off your balls, and slit my own throat!Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.60,0:27:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Why would you do that to yourself?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.36,0:28:01.15,Main,,0,0,0,,That's how a parent owns up to their own mistake!Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.24,0:28:07.37,Main,,0,0,0,,You fool... Don't become the type of person I despise.Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.80,0:28:13.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, get back to work.Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.53,0:28:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,That's been the rule since the age of the dinosaurs.Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.27,0:28:34.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-sama, it's time to leave.Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.73,0:28:39.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You all are going to the engagement ceremony at Whole Cake Chateau.Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.24,0:28:46.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Put this shirt on.Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.86,0:28:50.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a member of the Vinsmoke royal family.Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.29,0:28:53.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You need to look the part.Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.65,0:28:55.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What a joke...Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.44,0:29:10.64,Captions,,0,0,0,,Brûlée's Mirro-worldDialogue: 0,0:29:07.01,0:29:10.64,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, in Brûlée's Mirro-world...Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.64,0:29:13.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I found you!Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.94,0:29:19.27,Main,,0,0,0,,She's back!Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.26,0:29:23.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't escape!Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.79,0:29:35.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't run anymore, Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.46,0:29:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop running around all of my mirrors!Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.15,0:29:50.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Have a great wedding ceremony!Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.14,0:29:56.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.65,0:29:58.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.57,0:30:06.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Today is a new beginning for the Vinsmoke Family.Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.12,0:30:17.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.96,0:30:21.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Wave to the citizens, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.31,0:30:41.73,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let's go, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.01,0:31:03.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I've had enough, you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.56,0:31:06.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I seriously can't eat anymore!Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.53,0:31:09.93,Main,,0,0,0,,At your limit, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.93,0:31:15.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll never... throw up something that I've eaten!Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.64,0:31:23.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll make it easy for you by stabbing your belly!Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.15,0:31:24.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Look out, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.61,0:31:28.28,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it! I'm ending this now!Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.28,0:31:30.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Muscle BalloonDialogue: 0,0:31:53.09,0:31:54.30,Main,,0,0,0,,What the...?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.28,0:32:17.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Fourth!Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.17,0:32:28.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Tankman: Stuffed Version!Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.38,0:32:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! He's huge!Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.29,0:32:43.48,Main,,0,0,0,,You look quite different from your first transformation.Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.48,0:32:47.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you fight with that big fat body?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.32,0:32:55.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Cracker-sama's blade can't cut him!Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.61,0:32:57.16,Main,,0,0,0,,How hard is he?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.99,0:33:02.75,Main,,0,0,0,,You snot-nosed brat!Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.43,0:33:08.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't push your luck!Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.36,0:33:12.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.47,0:33:16.39,Main,,0,0,0,,If I can't cut you, I'll just stab you!Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.39,0:33:17.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Honey...Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.05,0:33:20.60,Main,,0,0,0,,... Pretzel!Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.76,0:33:26.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Not yet!Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.02,0:33:28.98,Main,,0,0,0,,With this thrust, you'll burst!Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.44,0:33:34.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Crush Pretzel!Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.54,0:33:45.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.26,0:33:56.76,Main,,0,0,0,,What is this? Is it hard or soft?Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.05,0:34:02.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh... What the hell is this?!Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.43,0:34:05.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Biscuit Soldiers!Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.48,0:34:09.90,Main,,0,0,0,,–Rain! –Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.90,0:34:14.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't make it rain on the Biscuits anymore! They can stay hard!Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.86,0:34:16.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.96,0:34:30.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't get out! What is he gonna do?!Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.54,0:34:33.78,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the power of a full stomach!Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.76,0:34:37.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.99,0:35:02.76,Main,,0,0,0,,... Cannon Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.19,0:34:55.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Fly away...Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.46,0:34:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,to the end of the New World!Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.74,0:35:45.70,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Title:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 1,0:00:00.57,0:00:03.10,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,IDialogue: 1,0:00:00.58,0:00:03.11,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 1,0:00:00.58,0:00:03.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,'Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.59,0:00:03.13,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:00:00.59,0:00:03.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.60,0:00:03.15,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:00:00.60,0:00:03.16,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:00:00.61,0:00:03.17,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 1,0:00:00.61,0:00:03.18,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.62,0:00:03.19,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 1,0:00:00.62,0:00:03.20,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:00:00.63,0:00:03.21,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:00:00.63,0:00:03.22,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:00:00.64,0:00:03.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.64,0:00:03.24,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,wDialogue: 1,0:00:00.65,0:00:03.25,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:00:00.65,0:00:03.26,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,'Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.66,0:00:03.27,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,vDialogue: 1,0:00:00.66,0:00:03.28,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:00:00.67,0:00:03.29,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.67,0:00:03.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:00:00.68,0:00:03.31,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:00:00.68,0:00:03.32,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:00:00.69,0:00:03.33,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:00:03.39,0:00:06.25,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 1,0:00:03.40,0:00:06.26,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 1,0:00:03.40,0:00:06.27,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:00:03.41,0:00:06.28,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.41,0:00